         1. [DONE] Map existing API endpoints.
         2. [IN PROGRESS] Implement OAuth2 flow. <-- CURRENT FOCUS
         3. [TODO] Add unit tests for the new flow.
        -->
    </task_state>
</state_snapshot>`.trim();
